# `mcp.create`

Register a new external MCP server (errors if the id is taken).

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.mcp.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type | required |
|------|------|----------|
| `id` | `string` | yes |
| `server_json` | `string` | yes |
| `scope` | `string?` | no |

## Returns

Status JSON (the mutation result).

## Invoke

```
ship ops call mcp.create --json '{ "id": "", "server_json": "" }'
```

Kind: command.
